{"title":"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/4/a84d131bf1421b0515fa69d4297e6b734781ff3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${{a}_{2}}, {{a}_{3}},  \\cdots, {{a}_{n}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" /> be positive real numbers that satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/e/d4e3c590c06886cdb762e96d3ceeebe6655f7d9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${{a}_{2}}\\cdot {{a}_{3}}\\cdots {{a}_{n}}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"14\" /> . Prove that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/9/da96a9bd18bbc8b4ae7cf8a1cf32fd86486bf885.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(a_2+1\\right)^2\\cdot \\left(a_3+1\\right)^3\\cdots \\left(a_n+1\\right)^n\\gneq n^n\\]\" width=\"294\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The inequality between arithmetic and geometric mean implies\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66a11ef0e8b0981697eb560e958e5322e000789f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[{{\\left( {{a}_{k}}+1 \\right)}^{k}}={{\\left( {{a}_{k}}+\\frac{1}{k-1}+\\frac{1}{k-1}+\\cdots +\\frac{1}{k-1} \\right)}^{k}}\\ge {{k}^{k}}\\cdot {{a}_{k}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{{{\\left( k-1 \\right)}^{k-1}}}=\\frac{{{k}^{k}}}{{{\\left( k-1 \\right)}^{k-1}}}\\cdot {{a}_{k}}\\]\" width=\"677\" height=\"50\" />\nThe inequality is strict unless <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/a/33aef681a33ed2fbb930f248fb4c7cca8d4de4f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k=\\frac1{k-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"85\" height=\"37\" />. Multiplying analogous inequalities for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/0/be0fe9f0bea866f36c035a987bcfe2749f8a3c4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=2,\\text{ 3, }\\cdots \\text{, }n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" /> yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/7/a47f6e0b9060c3692bc23683168537812a372489.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(a_2+1\\right)^2\\cdot \\left(a_3+1\\right)^3\\cdots \\left(a_n+n\\right)^n\\gneq \\frac{2^2}{1^1}\\cdot\\frac{3^3}{2^2}\\cdot \\frac{4^4}{3^3}\\cdots \\frac{n^n}{(n-1)^{n-1}}\\cdot a_2\\cdot a_3\\cdots a_n=n^n\\]\" width=\"588\" height=\"44\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO\" title=\"2012 IMO\">2012 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230801\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 70/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1796/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.464      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    7.464      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11428:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230801 and revision id 204551. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}